.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123535145,imgsize-231228.cms"/></item><item><title>Indian-origin Florida trucker crash sparks law review: Trump admin threatens funding cuts to state; says English language rule must</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123534394.cms" /&gt;The US government has issued a warning. California, Washington, and New Mexico may face cuts in safety funding. This is due to English language requirements for truck drivers. The move follows a fatal crash in Florida involving an Indian-origin driver, Harjinder Singh. Transportation Secretary Sean Duffy demands compliance within 30 days. States risk losing millions if they fail to comply.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-origin-florida-trucker-crash-sparks-law-review-trump-admin-threatens-funding-cuts-to-state-says-english-language-rule-must/articleshow/123534394.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-origin-florida-trucker-crash-sparks-law-review-trump-admin-threatens-funding-cuts-to-state-says-english-language-rule-must/articleshow/123534394.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-27T04:05:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123534446,imgsize-816604.cms"/></item><item><title>Watch: Shocking haboob videos show Phoenix choked by giant wall of dust; ‘It was darker than night’</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123532262.cms" /&gt;A massive haboob recently swept through Phoenix, Arizona, causing flight disruptions and power outages for thousands. The intense dust storm, fueled by monsoon season winds, reduced visibility and prompted safety warnings. While haboobs are common in the region, concerns are rising about the potential for increased intensity due to land degradation.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-shocking-haboob-videos-show-phoenix-choked-by-giant-wall-of-dust-it-was-darker-than-night/articleshow/123532262.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-shocking-haboob-videos-show-phoenix-choked-by-giant-wall-of-dust-it-was-darker-than-night/articleshow/123532262.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-27T00:23:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123533204,imgsize-3853286.cms"/></item><item><title>‘Head’s going to spin’: Trump reiterates tariff warning forced quick resolution between India, Pak; recalls pressuring PM Modi over nuclear fears</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123533862.cms" /&gt;Donald Trump stated he stopped a nuclear war between India and Pakistan. He threatened India with high tariffs. Trump claimed Narendra Modi was involved. He said both sides backed down after his intervention. India has denied any third-party involvement. Rajnath Singh said the ceasefire was India's decision. Narendra Modi and other ministers have refuted Trump's claims.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/heads-going-to-spin-trump-reiterates-tariff-warning-forced-quick-resolution-between-india-pak-recalls-pressuring-pm-modi-over-nuclear-fears/articleshow/123533862.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/heads-going-to-spin-trump-reiterates-tariff-warning-forced-quick-resolution-between-india-pak-recalls-pressuring-pm-modi-over-nuclear-fears/articleshow/123533862.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-27T01:54:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123534033,imgsize-1231924.cms"/></item><item><title>‘Admit the mistake’: Donald Trump urges Cracker Barrel to ditch new logo; calls it ‘billion dollar opportunity’</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123529184.cms" /&gt;Donald Trump has advised Cracker Barrel to revert to its old logo amid backlash over its modern rebranding. Trump suggested the company admit its mistake, hold a press conference, and capitalize on the situation for positive publicity. He linked the situation to his own presidency, claiming he made the U.S. the 'hottest' country.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/admit-the-mistake-donald-trump-urges-cracker-barrel-to-ditch-new-logo-calls-it-billion-dollar-opportunity/articleshow/123529184.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/admit-the-mistake-donald-trump-urges-cracker-barrel-to-ditch-new-logo-calls-it-billion-dollar-opportunity/articleshow/123529184.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T21:47:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI News Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123529676,imgsize-1064952.cms"/></item><item><title>Billion-dollar bet? Donald Trump Jr’s VC fund invests millions in Polymarket; joins prediction market as advisor</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123530286.cms" /&gt;Donald Trump Jr.'s 1789 Capital has invested in Polymarket, valuing the prediction market platform at over $1 billion. Trump Jr. will also serve as a Strategic Advisor. This investment follows the closure of regulatory investigations and Polymarket's acquisition of QCEX, paving the way for potential US market entry. 1789 Capital views Polymarket as a future IPO candidate. Trump Jr.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/billion-dollar-bet-donald-trump-jrs-vc-fund-invests-millions-in-polymarket-joins-prediction-market-as-advisor/articleshow/123530286.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/billion-dollar-bet-donald-trump-jrs-vc-fund-invests-millions-in-polymarket-joins-prediction-market-as-advisor/articleshow/123530286.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T22:23:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123530353,imgsize-954687.cms"/></item><item><title>'I’d never say she’s beautiful, because ... ': Trump flirts awkwardly with Bondi</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123534057.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/id-never-say-shes-beautiful-because-trump-flirts-awkwardly-with-attorney-general-pam-bondi-rambles-3hr-16min-in-chaotic-cabinet-meeting/articleshow/123534057.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/id-never-say-shes-beautiful-because-trump-flirts-awkwardly-with-attorney-general-pam-bondi-rambles-3hr-16min-in-chaotic-cabinet-meeting/articleshow/123534057.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-27T02:17:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123534060,imgsize-382358.cms"/></item><item><title>Taylor Swift and Travis Kelce engaged: MAGA world reacts — and you won’t believe what they said</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123533389.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/taylor-swift-and-travis-kelce-engaged-maga-world-reacts-and-you-wont-believe-what-they-said/articleshow/123533389.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/taylor-swift-and-travis-kelce-engaged-maga-world-reacts-and-you-wont-believe-what-they-said/articleshow/123533389.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-27T00:49:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123533604,imgsize-61616.cms"/></item><item><title>‘Capital, capital punishment’: Trump pushes death penalty for DC murders rs</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123533919.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/capital-capital-punishment-trump-pushes-death-penalty-for-washington-dc-murders-but-city-has-rejected-it-for-40-years/articleshow/123533919.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/capital-capital-punishment-trump-pushes-death-penalty-for-washington-dc-murders-but-city-has-rejected-it-for-40-years/articleshow/123533919.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-27T01:30:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123533978,imgsize-26286.cms"/></item><item><title>‘We’re going to change the green card’: Trump team plots H-1B shake-up — what it means for Indians</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123528880.cms" /&gt;The Trump administration plans to revamp the US H-1B visa and green card systems. The current lottery system may be replaced with wage-based allocation. A 'Gold Card' initiative is also under consideration. This aims to attract high-skilled, high-earning individuals. Howard Lutnick calls the current H-1B system a scam. These changes align with Trump's 'America First' immigration policy.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/were-going-to-change-the-green-card-trump-team-plots-h-1b-shake-up-what-it-means-for-indians/articleshow/123528880.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/were-going-to-change-the-green-card-trump-team-plots-h-1b-shake-up-what-it-means-for-indians/articleshow/123528880.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T20:59:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123529088,imgsize-1184831.cms"/></item><item><title>Trump’s shocking reaction to Taylor Swift and Travis Kelce’s engagement | Watch</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123533775.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/i-hate-taylor-swift-to-i-wish-them-luck-donald-trumps-shocking-reaction-to-taylor-swift-and-travis-kelces-engagement-watch/articleshow/123533775.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/i-hate-taylor-swift-to-i-wish-them-luck-donald-trumps-shocking-reaction-to-taylor-swift-and-travis-kelces-engagement-watch/articleshow/123533775.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-27T01:05:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123533784,imgsize-32578.cms"/></item><item><title>‘World’s highest dumpster’ gets a fix: Drones airlift tonnes of trash from Mt Everest — how it works</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123533001.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/worlds-highest-dumpster-gets-a-fix-20000-drones-airlift-tonnes-of-trash-from-mount-everest-heres-how-it-works/articleshow/123533001.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/worlds-highest-dumpster-gets-a-fix-20000-drones-airlift-tonnes-of-trash-from-mount-everest-heres-how-it-works/articleshow/123533001.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-27T00:22:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123533199,imgsize-354745.cms"/></item><item><title>'The architect of Epstein’s Deal': Why Alex Acosta is back in the hot seat</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123530374.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/the-architect-of-epsteins-deal-why-alex-acosta-is-back-in-the-hot-seat-his-2008-decision-the-fallout-and-what-happens-next/articleshow/123530374.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/the-architect-of-epsteins-deal-why-alex-acosta-is-back-in-the-hot-seat-his-2008-decision-the-fallout-and-what-happens-next/articleshow/123530374.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T22:31:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123530498,imgsize-93604.cms"/></item><item><title>Weapons, food and living quarters: IDF dismantles 'Hamas underground tunnels' – watch</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123527205.cms" /&gt;The IDF revealed the dismantling of Hamas's offensive tunnel routes, complete with living facilities and weapons, which were then sealed with concrete. Dozens of terrorists were reportedly eliminated during the operation, with terror infrastructure destroyed both above and below ground.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/weapons-food-and-living-quarters-idf-dismantles-hamas-underground-tunnels-watch/articleshow/123527205.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/weapons-food-and-living-quarters-idf-dismantles-hamas-underground-tunnels-watch/articleshow/123527205.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T19:04:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123527553,imgsize-5131066.cms"/></item><item><title>What is Tolebrutinib? The world’s first oral treatment approved in UAE for progressive multiple sclerosis</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123528836.cms" /&gt;The UAE has approved Tolebrutinib, the world’s first oral treatment for non-relapsing secondary progressive multiple sclerosis (SPMS). Developed to slow disability progression without relying on relapse control, it targets brain inflammation via B cells and microglia. This breakthrough highlights the Emirates Drug Establishment’s commitment to advancing neurological care and accelerating access to innovative, science-backed therapies.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/what-is-tolebrutinib-the-worlds-first-oral-treatment-approved-in-uae-for-progressive-multiple-sclerosis/articleshow/123528836.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/what-is-tolebrutinib-the-worlds-first-oral-treatment-approved-in-uae-for-progressive-multiple-sclerosis/articleshow/123528836.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T22:18:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123530149,imgsize-687705.cms"/></item><item><title>Donald Trump vs Fed governor: US President’s attempts to fire Lisa Cook might land in legal battle; Biden appointee vows not to resign</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123529511.cms" /&gt;Donald Trump's attempt to dismiss Federal Reserve governor Lisa Cook over alleged mortgage fraud is expected to face legal challenges, questioning presidential authority over the Fed's independence. Cook denies the allegations and refuses to resign, setting the stage for a potential Supreme Court battle.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/international-business/donald-trump-vs-fed-governor-us-presidents-attempts-to-fire-lisa-cook-might-land-in-legal-battle-biden-appointee-vows-not-to-resign/articleshow/123529511.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/international-business/donald-trump-vs-fed-governor-us-presidents-attempts-to-fire-lisa-cook-might-land-in-legal-battle-biden-appointee-vows-not-to-resign/articleshow/123529511.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T21:52:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Business Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123529579,imgsize-1118388.cms"/></item><item><title>Is Trump hiding brain condition? Psychologists warn of ‘worsening motor decline</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123529514.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/dead-ringer-sign-trump-boasts-highest-mark-on-cognitive-test-but-psychologists-point-to-red-carpet-stumble-as-warning-of-brain-decline/articleshow/123529514.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/dead-ringer-sign-trump-boasts-highest-mark-on-cognitive-test-but-psychologists-point-to-red-carpet-stumble-as-warning-of-brain-decline/articleshow/123529514.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T21:41:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123529538,imgsize-40196.cms"/></item><item><title>'US will lead again in AI': Melania rolls out national challenge for kids — here’s the catch</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123529131.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/america-will-lead-again-in-ai-melania-trump-rolls-out-national-challenge-for-kids-heres-the-catch/articleshow/123529131.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/america-will-lead-again-in-ai-melania-trump-rolls-out-national-challenge-for-kids-heres-the-catch/articleshow/123529131.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T21:27:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123529410,imgsize-108798.cms"/></item><item><title>'What is going on?': Donald Trump turns heat on South Korea’s President Lee Jae Myung ahead of meet</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123529118.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/what-is-going-on-donald-trump-turns-heat-on-south-koreas-president-lee-jae-myung-ahead-of-meet/articleshow/123529118.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/what-is-going-on-donald-trump-turns-heat-on-south-koreas-president-lee-jae-myung-ahead-of-meet/articleshow/123529118.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T21:09:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Chidanand Rajghatta</dc:creator><enclosure type=